( aa)
exempting places of employment from the application of this Act;

( bb)
respecting forms for use under this Act;

( cc)
respecting records to be kept by employers and submitted to the Commission;

( dd)
prescribing the fees payable by employers for inspections required under this Act;

( dd.1)
respecting the content, duration, administration and delivery of an educational program for persons who are or may become members of joint health and safety committees and or a health and safety representative;

( dd.2)
prescribing trades for the purposes of subsection 14.4 (1);

( ee)
prescribing duties to be performed by committees and respecting procedures for the operation of committees and the making of reports by committees.

